# A35x recovery: TEEGRIS startup is owned by
# /init.recovery.teegris.rc.
#
# Do not start tz_service here or wait_for_prop for vendor.tzdaemon /
# vendor.tzts_daemon. The recovery init file starts these daemons in a
# non-blocking, property-triggered sequence after trustlet extraction.
# Keeping the old post-fs wait_for_prop sequence here can block init before
# the recovery UI is launched when a TEE daemon never reaches Ready.

on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data/vendor/tee 0700 system system
